        "description": "Certain 2020-2026 SQ8 vehicles are included in NHTSA recall 25V900 / Audi 90TV because a software issue can prevent the rearview camera image from displaying. The amended filing lists 11,590 SQ8 vehicles, but eligibility depends on VIN and the installed parts and software rather than model year alone. A missing rearview image reduces visibility while reversing and increases crash risk.",
